# The retrieval corpus is fetched, not shipped. 4.5MB of .rst that this image
# never reads: the app container runs the 1.4 app, and whichever machine embeds
# the corpus runs `python -m rag.corpus` for itself. Same rule as issues.db —
# the image holds code, the container holds data. corpus/MANIFEST.json is small
# and IS copied, so a container can still say what the corpus should contain.
corpus/raw/